      "y": 265,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 90,
      "text": "PROS:\n• Familiar pattern (billions know quote tweets)\n• Story shows the Point it responds to\n• Position badge shows Agree/Disagree at glance\n• Works in feed AND in Point detail\n• Embedded Point is tappable (navigate to it)",
